ACTION:

14.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending Ordinance No. 4519 amending the Official
Zoning Map of the City of Cheyenne changing the zoning classification from HI Heavy
Industrial, AG Agricultural, and County A-2 to LI Light Industrial for land located west
of Burlington Trail and south of and adjacent to HR Ranch Road.

ACTION:

15.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending Subsections 6.5.4.b.3 Incentives / Bonus,
6.5.4.b.4 Creative Sign Program, and 6.5.8.j Billboards of the Unified Development
Code, to restructure sign incentives and bonuses by modifying allowances for signs near
interstate highways, allowances for shared signs, eliminating the Creative Sign Program,
and clarifying applicability of certain billboard allowances.

ACTION:
